--- !u!1001 &453752372
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 221071069}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: An imaginary number is the product of a real number and the imaginary
        unit i.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[1]._dialogueText
      value: "This unit is defined by its property i\xB2 = \u22121."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[2]._dialogueText
      value: As example, 6i is an imaginary number, and that number squared will
        be -36.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[3]._dialogueText
      value: 'Complex numbers are numbers that have two parts: a real part and an
        imaginary part.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[4]._dialogueText
      value: "They\u2019re always written in the form a + bi, where (a) is the real
        part, (b) is the imaginary part, and (i) is the imaginary unit."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 22.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.y
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.z
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalRotation.w
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
