--- !u!1001 &825780823
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 221071069}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: The discriminant of a polynomial is a function of the coefficients of
        the polynomial.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[1]._dialogueText
      value: It is helpful in determining what type of solutions a polynomial equation
        has without finding them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[2]._dialogueText
      value: I would suggest noting this down when you get the chance!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[3]._dialogueText
      value: "For a quadratic equation, the formula, \u0394 = b\xB2 - 4ac, determines
        the nature of the roots."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[4]._dialogueText
      value: "If \u0394 > 0, there are 2 distinct real roots."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[5]._dialogueText
      value: "If \u0394 = 0, there\u2019s 1 real root (double root)."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[6]._dialogueText
      value: "And if \u0394 < 0, there are 2 complex conjugate roots."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 79
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.y
      value: 12
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.z
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
