--- !u!1001 &1042354520
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 221071069}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: A complex conjugate of a complex number is a number that flips the sign
        of the imaginary part while keeping the real part the same.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[1]._dialogueText
      value: "If you have a complex number, z = a + bi, its complex conjugate is
        z\u02C9  = a - bi.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3657750595127706157, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueObjects.Array.data[2]._dialogueText
      value: You can add, subtract, multiply, and divide complex numbers with other
        complex numbers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7782682502209912324, guid: 83f67faf358644b34ad60e68c9dc8f56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
